protocol [https:] user [user] pw [pw]
hostname [example.com] port 8080  host [example.com:8080]
pathname [/a/b/file.txt] search [?q=1&x=%41%zz&s=a+b] hash [#frag]
origin [https://example.com:8080] queryCount 3 
format [https://user:pw@example.com:8080/a/b/file.txt?q=1&x=%41%zz&s=a+b#frag]
basename [file] ext [.txt] dir [/a/b]
q [1] x [A%zz] s [a b] none []
after set q [two words&more] new [v] count 4 
search [?q=two%20words%26more&x=%41%zz&s=a+b&new=v]
href [https://user:pw@example.com:8080/a/b/file.txt?q=two%20words%26more&x=%41%zz&s=a+b&new=v#frag]
port 65535  path [/]
mailto [mailto:] [someone@example.com] host []
encode [a%20b%2Fc%3Fd%3De%26f~_.-] decode [a b/c%zz%4]
normalize [/a/g] [mid/6] [/]
 [g:h] -> g:h
 [g] -> http://a/b/c/g
 [./g] -> http://a/b/c/g
 [g/] -> http://a/b/c/g/
 [/g] -> http://a/g
 [//g] -> http://g/
 [?y] -> http://a/b/c/d;p?y
 [g?y] -> http://a/b/c/g?y
 [#s] -> http://a/b/c/d;p?q#s
 [g#s] -> http://a/b/c/g#s
 [g?y#s] -> http://a/b/c/g?y#s
 [;x] -> http://a/b/c/;x
 [g;x] -> http://a/b/c/g;x
 [g;x?y#s] -> http://a/b/c/g;x?y#s
 [] -> http://a/b/c/d;p?q
 [.] -> http://a/b/c/
 [./] -> http://a/b/c/
 [..] -> http://a/b/
 [../] -> http://a/b/
 [../g] -> http://a/b/g
 [../..] -> http://a/
 [../../] -> http://a/
 [../../g] -> http://a/g
 [../../../g] -> http://a/g
 [../../../../g] -> http://a/g
 [/./g] -> http://a/g
 [/../g] -> http://a/g
 [g.] -> http://a/b/c/g.
 [..g] -> http://a/b/c/..g
 [g..] -> http://a/b/c/g..
 [./../g] -> http://a/b/g
 [./g/.] -> http://a/b/c/g/
 [g/./h] -> http://a/b/c/g/h
 [g/../h] -> http://a/b/c/h
 [g;x=1/./y] -> http://a/b/c/g;x=1/y
 [g;x=1/../y] -> http://a/b/c/y
file:///C:/dir%20name/f%231.txt C:/dir name/f.txt /usr/lib
done
